            0.153,
            0.237,
            0.775,
            0.258
          ],
          "content": "How does one construct a triangle having these measurements?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.154,
            0.262,
            0.552,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": "**Step 1:** Draw the base PQ of length 6 cm."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.284,
            0.77,
            0.305
          ],
          "content": "**Step 2:** Draw a line l from P that makes an angle of $3 0 ^ { \\circ }$ with PQ."
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "bbox": [
            0.337,
            0.326,
            0.67,
            0.484
          ],
          "content": "",
