        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.114,
            0.779,
            0.687,
            0.802
          ],
          "content": "？ How do we find the required triangle from this figure?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.153,
            0.811,
            0.85,
            0.869
          ],
          "content": "A point of intersection of the arc and the line l gives the third point of the required triangle. But we see that the arc intersects the line l at two different points R and S."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.177,
            0.869,
            0.703,
            0.889
          ],
          "content": "Both ΔPQR and ΔPQS satisfy the given measurements."
